const PROMPTS = [
  {
    name: 'deploy_notice',
    description: 'Generate a deployment notice for a service and version.',
    arguments: [
      { name: 'service', description: 'Name of the service being deployed', required: true },
      { name: 'version', description: 'Version being deployed', required: true }
    ]
  }
];
```

For `getPrompt`:
- Validate the prompt name exists
- Validate required args present and non-empty strings
- Reject extra args

